    "summary": "No earlier study tested the reliability of H2-H1 opponent scoring change as a team defensive trait. The closest work tested reliability of a different derived player-level metric and found it unreliable; another study showed that inferential defensive labels are noisy. Both inform the methodological risks but do not answer the current question."
